{title: 549 Ya el fin se acerca}
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{lyricist: Juan B. Cabrera}
{composer: Felix Mendelssohn (1809-1847)}

   [D]                 [G]  [D] [Em] [D]     [A7] [D]        [A]
